    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d159">

                <pb facs="0152" n="142" sameAs="frus:frus1937v05/pg142"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">710.Asylum/7</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Weddell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1701</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1937-08-10"
                            >August 10, 1937</date>.<lb/>[Received August 19.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to refer to my despatch
                    No. 1686 of July 29,<anchor n="3" xml:id="d159-f1"/> with which was forwarded in
                    original and translation the text of the proposed convention on the right of
                    asylum which has been drafted by the Argentine Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
                <p>The translation referred to was prepared by the Embassy, which has now received
                    from the Foreign Office an official English translation <pb facs="0153" n="143"
                        xml:id="pg143"/> which is forwarded herewith. This text has been compared
                    with the one prepared by the Embassy and has been found to be substantially in
                    agreement with the latter.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alexander W.
                    Weddell</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d159-a1.xml" xpointer="d159-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
